### GetAccount: existing account → expect OK
GRPC {{grpcHost}}/accounts.v1.AccountsService/GetAccount
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
"account_id": 1
}

### GetAccount: nonexisting account → expect NOT_FOUND
GRPC {{grpcHost}}/accounts.v1.AccountsService/GetAccount
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "account_id": 9999999
}

### GetAccount: incorrect account ID → expect INVALID_ARGUMENT
GRPC {{grpcHost}}/accounts.v1.AccountsService/GetAccount
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "account_id": -1
}

### GetAccounts
GRPC localhost:8081/accounts.v1.AccountsService/GetAccounts
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}